# UI work

Read [redesign/system.md](redesign/system.md) and **only** the page spec that matches the file being edited:

- Home → `redesign/home.md`
- Work list / case study chrome → `redesign/work.md`
- Header / nav / command menu → `redesign/header.md`
- About → `redesign/about.md`

Do not load all redesign specs for a single-page change.
Do not open case-study markdown or project-standards unless the task is about content.
